            "dataset_note": {
              "default": "BWB (Basiswettenbestand) is the official consolidated body of Dutch national legislation, served by KOOP over SRU. Each act is identified by a BWB id (e.g. BWBR0005537) and has many time-stamped versions (toestanden); tools default to the version in force on a given date (today unless on_date is set). The Netherlands does NOT publish native ELI (/eli/) URIs on consolidated BWB - eli_uri carries the official persistent identifier (the wetten.overheid.nl/id toestand URI). This MVP covers consolidated legislation; case law is exposed separately via the Rechtspraak tools.",
